The official upstream LICENSE is copied at LICENSE.upstream.

The default pretrained checkpoints are downloaded at runtime from the public
Hugging Face catalog lj1995/VoiceConversionWebUI and are not redistributed in
this image (except the tiny official mute.zip used as silent training rows).

The example dataset in examples/datasets/tiny_voice.zip is short public-domain
speech from LibriSpeech (LibriVox-derived, used only as a pipeline smoke test).
It is not a third-party commercial or celebrity voice, and it will not produce
a high-quality model.
